@startuml

skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #213B4B
skinparam titleFontColor #163E4C
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #567083
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam nodesep 36
skinparam ranksep 38
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F7F9FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #99ABB8
skinparam noteFontSize 13
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #F7F9FB
skinparam legendBorderColor #99ABB8

hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 15
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontStyle bold
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF5F8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #507084
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #99ABB8
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #788D9D
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EFF5F8
skinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

title 正常预约 · 一次明确的提交边界
actor "买家" as Buyer
boundary "Web API" as API
control "商品交易服务\nProductWorkflow" as Service #E8F4EF
entity "商品与预约\nProduct / Reservation" as Domain
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Buyer -> API : 预约(productID, expectedVersion,\n交付时间地点, submissionKey)
API -> API : 认证；检查当前对象读取权限
API -> Service : execute(创建预约, 当前买家)
group T · READ COMMITTED，所有 SQL 使用同一连接
  Service -> DB : BEGIN；取得 K 的事务级锁
  Service -> DB : 锁后查 OperationResult(K)
  DB --> Service : 未处理
  Service -> DB : SELECT 商品 FOR UPDATE\n随后读取当前有效预约
  DB --> Service : 已发布、无有效预约、最新 version
  Service -> Service : 校验操作权限、expectedVersion\n非自购、交付约定、锁后服务器时间
  note over Service, DB
    本图展示无到期占用的正常路径。
    若发现到期占用，按 X0 先独立过期，再从 K 检查重入。
  end note
  Service -> Domain : createReservation(buyer, terms, now)
  Domain --> Service : 新预约待确认；商品已预约\nversion + 1；约定快照
  Service -> DB : 写预约、商品、最终 SUCCESS 结果\n及一条成功 CHANGE 审计
  Service -> DB : 检查 I1-I7；COMMIT
  DB --[#26725E]> Service : 全部提交完成
end
Service --> API : 原预约编号、已提交结果、当前状态
API --> Buyer : 预约成功，等待卖家确认

legend bottom
  K = (用户, 动作, 提交标记)。无独立提交的“处理中”记录。
  业务拒绝：不改业务，保存 REJECTED 结果与失败说明后提交。
  任一写入失败：整个 T 回滚；提交结果不明：保留原 K 查询重试，见幂等图。
endlegend

@enduml
